B.E.T.H. (Basic Everyday Task Helper) and the Action Lab research harness are
experimental on-device machine learning tools provided for research, evaluation,
and demonstration purposes. They are not intended for use in mission-critical,
safety-critical, emergency, or automated decision-making environments where
